### Transformations:
1. Z-score normalization: Apply to features with distinct distributions across vehicle types (e.g., COMPACTNESS, CIRCULARITY, RADIUS_RATIO, SCATTER_RATIO, HOLLOWS_RATIO) to standardize scales and highlight their deviations.
